{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"e849f5bc7d632a1e","type":"text","text":"Dynamic Routing Protocols","x":-95,"y":-113,"width":250,"height":60,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"756e401382bd05ce","type":"text","text":"Link State","x":-1094,"y":730,"width":114,"height":60,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"35df399445e8b2b8","type":"text","text":"OSPF","x":-1094,"y":830,"width":114,"height":60},
		{"id":"4ef0071e10392c79","type":"text","text":"IS-IS","x":-1094,"y":890,"width":114,"height":60},
		{"id":"14088e79345cfcea","type":"text","text":"Exterior Gateway Protocol (EGP)","x":-920,"y":600,"width":300,"height":60,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"34c650e4b667160d","type":"text","text":"Path Vector","x":-827,"y":730,"width":114,"height":60,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"bca5187d203c25c1","type":"text","text":"BGP","x":-827,"y":830,"width":114,"height":60},
		{"id":"2d8158c8ea27811f","type":"text","text":"### What is a Gateway Protocol?\n- Set of rules that allow networks to share routing information, translate date formats, and direct traffic between different computer networks\n### Difference between IGP and EGP\n- IGP shares routes within an autonomous system\n- EGP shares routes between different autonomous systems","x":-1620,"y":600,"width":315,"height":405},
		{"id":"6e88418610702c80","type":"text","text":"Interior Gateway Protocol (IGP)","x":-1240,"y":600,"width":292,"height":60,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"085c510b51c65b9c","type":"text","text":"Distance Vector","x":-1212,"y":730,"width":114,"height":60,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"a8847537b942a55d","type":"text","text":"RIP","x":-1212,"y":830,"width":114,"height":60},
		{"id":"24a027e7a1222f8a","type":"text","text":"EIGRP","x":-1212,"y":890,"width":114,"height":60},
		{"id":"85421b681bead8cc","type":"text","text":"Types of Dynamic Routing Protocol","x":-1251,"y":410,"width":315,"height":60,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"1bedcfc5204d6064","type":"text","text":"What Problem does it Solve?","x":800,"y":525,"width":315,"height":60,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"59e0b8a2d1972138","type":"text","text":"- Manually setting up static routes for a large network is tedious and wastes a lot of time. \n- Allow the network to be resilient to changes in the network topology","x":800,"y":615,"width":315,"height":240},
		{"id":"32068fda37822799","type":"text","text":"How does it Solve it?","x":1147,"y":525,"width":315,"height":60,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"b6b4189c0cd7250d","type":"text","text":"- By doing neighbour advertisments","x":1147,"y":615,"width":315,"height":240},
		{"id":"2951d4da68aadc28","type":"text","text":"### What is Administrative Distance?\n-  Number used to choose between which dynamic routing protocol to choose \n- The lowest metric gets chosen (a lower number means better)\n\n### What is a Metric?\n- Number used to measure the cost of quality of a specific path\n- The lowest metric gets chosen (a lower number means better)\n","x":-512,"y":545,"width":340,"height":495},
		{"id":"2e6398dba1c00be4","type":"text","text":"Administrative Distance","x":-122,"y":545,"width":315,"height":60,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"0c6eef735f52fe7e","type":"text","text":"Metric","x":245,"y":545,"width":315,"height":60,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"29db607bf9138f18","type":"text","text":"Metrics","x":-52,"y":410,"width":175,"height":60,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"09690dbe393d2ce6","type":"text","text":"| AD Value | Protocol/Setting    |     |\n| -------- | ------------------- | --- |\n| 0        | Directly Connected  |     |\n| 1        | Static Route        |     |\n| 5        | EIGRP Summary Route |     |\n| 20       | EBGP                |     |\n| 90       | Internal EIGRP      |     |\n| 100      | IGRP                |     |\n| 110      | OSPF                |     |\n| 115      | IS-IS               |     |\n| 120      | RIP                 |     |\n| 170      | External EIGRP      |     |\n| 200      | IBGP                |     |\n| 255      | Unknown             |     |\n","x":-122,"y":605,"width":315,"height":435},
		{"id":"aef73170c74b5d5f","type":"text","text":"EIGRP","x":-95,"y":-300,"width":250,"height":60,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"af4395692d47d654","type":"text","text":"RIP","x":-467,"y":-113,"width":250,"height":60,"color":"1"},
